WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.220
No, they are actually, as we speak, trying to overthrow the core law enforcement function

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:07.460
of the federal government.

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:10.900
Of course, this is, I think, what we're talking past each other.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:17.180
When ICE officers have to street battle against Antifa, hand-to-hand combat every night to

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:21.680
come and go from their building, when they try to exit in a vehicle, when they are swarmed

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:26.860
and surrounded and they try to tip the vehicle over, when people bring weapons to an ICE

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:32.340
facility to try to engage in direct violent assault against ICE officers, what is the

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.340
purpose?

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:38.299
It is to prevent Immigration and Customs Enforcement from carrying out the mission the American

00:00:38.299 --> 00:00:39.740
people elected them to do.

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:49.099
You make the case that these are terrorists, but in what we've seen thus far, the actual

00:00:49.099 --> 00:00:55.560
incidents of people inciting violence and not responding to law enforcement attempting

00:00:55.560 --> 00:01:00.320
to disperse them are not an open rebellion.

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:06.480
I mean, again, you make this characterization as though they're terrorists, and I do wonder

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:07.599
if it...

